{"4456220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AnUncommonWinter", "steam_appid": 4456220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AnUncommonWinter is a game of survival and progression through different worlds with various features :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- EXPLORE ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world is unique. What makes exploration even more interesting, the more you progress, the more different resources you will discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- UPGRADES ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can upgrade their characters and buildings as they progress through the game to become even stronger, but also to obtain unique appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- BUILDING ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most important features is building, which allows players to build their base, survive in their environment, and farm even more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AnUncommonWinter is a game of survival and progression through different worlds with various features :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- EXPLORE ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world is unique. What makes exploration even more interesting, the more you progress, the more different resources you will discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- UPGRADES ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can upgrade their characters and buildings as they progress through the game to become even stronger, but also to obtain unique appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- BUILDING ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most important features is building, which allows players to build their base, survive in their environment, and farm even mor